Social Media API 

Abstract 

Create a social media platform API using Express and TypeScript with user profile management, post creation and editing, likes and comments functionality, follow/unfollow system, and news feed generation. Implement JWT-based authentication, role-based authorization for admin functions, and real-time notification triggers. The API will follow RESTful conventions, use TypeScript generics for reusable components, and implement pagination for large datasets. 

Tools and Technologies 

Express.js: RESTful API framework 

TypeScript: Interfaces, generics, decorators 

JWT: Authentication tokens 

bcrypt: Secure password storage 

Express middleware: Auth, validation, CORS 

TypeScript generics: Type-safe API responses 

Pagination: Limit and offset patterns 


